O:8:"stdClass":8:{s:5:"title";s:80:"Exploring wilderness in one of the lower forty-eight’s most untamed landscapes";s:4:"link";s:118:"https://environment.uw.edu/news/2015/08/exploring-wilderness-in-one-of-the-lower-forty-eights-most-untamed-landscapes/";s:11:"description";s:428:"<div>What is wilderness?
